                        <sc:DescriptorValue>The junction priority record provides information about the priority of one road over another road that are part of this junction. It is only required if priorities cannot be derived from signs or signals in a junction or on tracks leading to a junction.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
