                            <sc:DescriptorValue>Lane on which cars should not drive. The lane has the same height as drivable lanes. Typically, the lane is separated with lines and often contains dotted lines as well.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                          </sc:descriptorValues>
                        </sc:definition>
