                <sc:Class>
                  <sc:name>t_road_lanes_laneSection_lcr_lane_link</sc:name>
                  <sc:id>50</sc:id>
                  <sc:descriptors>
                    <sc:definition>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>For links between lanes with an identical road reference line, the lane predecessor and successor information provide the IDs of lanes on the preceding or following lane section.&#xD;&#xA;For links between lanes with different road reference line,  the lane predecessor and successor information provide the IDs of lanes on the first or last lane section of the other road reference line depending on the contact point of the road linkage.&#xD;&#xA;This element may only be omitted, if lanes end at a junction or have no physical link.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>For links between lanes with an identical road reference line, the lane predecessor and successor information provide the IDs of lanes on the preceding or following lane section.&#xD;&#xA;For links between lanes with different road reference line,  the lane predecessor and successor information provide the IDs of lanes on the first or last lane section of the other road reference line depending on the contact point of the road linkage.&#xD;&#xA;This element may only be omitted, if lanes end at a junction or have no physical link.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:documentation>
                  </sc:descriptors>
                  <sc:supertypes>
                    <sc:SupertypeId>159</sc:SupertypeId>
                  </sc:supertypes>
