                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Relocates the lateral reference position for the following (explicit) type definition and thus defines an offset. The sway offset is relative to the nominal reference position of the lane marking, meaning the lane border.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
