                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Tunnels are modeled as objects in ASAM OpenDRIVE. The road with the tunnel object defines the part of the road that is the tunnel or the underpass.&#xD;&#xA;Tunnels are valid for the complete cross section of a road unless a lane validity element with further restrictions is provided as child element</sc:DescriptorValue>
