                  <sc:descriptors>
                    <sc:definition>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Signal references link a signal to another signal or object. One signal may have multiple signal references. The signal reference term should not to be confused with the `&lt;signalReference&gt;` element that is used to link a signal to multiple roads.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Signal references link a signal to another signal or object. One signal may have multiple signal references. The signal reference term should not to be confused with the `&lt;signalReference&gt;` element that is used to link a signal to multiple roads.</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
