                <sc:Class>
                  <sc:name>t_controller</sc:name>
                  <sc:id>136</sc:id>
                  <sc:descriptors>
                    <sc:definition>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Controllers provide a signal program for a traffic signal or a signal group. The mapping of traffic signals to a signal group is done in t_controller. Dynamic content like the signal program itself is specified outside of this standard (i.e. in OpenSCENARIO).</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:definition>
                    <sc:documentation>
                      <sc:descriptorValues>
                        <sc:DescriptorValue>Controllers provide a signal program for a traffic signal or a signal group. The mapping of traffic signals to a signal group is done in t_controller. Dynamic content like the signal program itself is specified outside of this standard (i.e. in OpenSCENARIO).</sc:DescriptorValue>
                      </sc:descriptorValues>
                    </sc:documentation>
                  </sc:descriptors>
